		<h1>Bibliotheca Avatar</h1>

<p>Click on a link below for the transcript of that article.</p>

<hr><h1>Cazic Thule Jewelcraft <span class=tiny>by Ashlamar Starbreeze</span></h1><p><span class=footnote></span></p><p>The Cazic Thule zone was massively changed on March 7, 2002. Along with new, nastier mobs, there were new recipe books that dropped. All require drops from the Cazic Thule zone, and most need either more translating, or the drops are missing/too rare for us to find. <br>Below are the pertinent comments from books 2 through 5. (Book 1 contained no tradeskill information.) As you can see, much more research is needed before we have these recipes nailed down. We've had confirmation for some of the drops, but still not all of them.<br><br>Jewelcrafting (from the books)<br><br>Day 2. Within the mounds of jumble I found a strange ore. It seems local to this area's geology - and has fascinating properties. Using my firestaff as a makeshift forge I found that two lumps of this ore could be enchanted with a vile of distilled mana - interesting. <br><br>Day 4. The enchanted ore seems to bond well with certain jewels I have with me: Diamonds, blue diamonds, sapphires, black sapphires, and rubies. I shall note these for further investigation on our return to the academy. <br>-------------<br>From this, enterprising experimenters have found the following ...<br><br>enchanted cazicite bar: 2 cazicite chunks, 1 vial of distilled mana (requires 2 sapphires per vial) **combine in forge** (trivial <=141) <br><br>enchanted cazicite bar + [gem] (diamond, blue diamond, black sapphire, ruby, sapphire) = cazicite jewelry <br><br>cazicite black sapphire earring: AC 2, mana 15, HP 15, sv cold 8, sv fire 8, sv magic 8, sv posion 13, sv disease 13, recommended level 51, all/all <br><br>cazicite blue diamond ring: AC 4, HP 10, mana 10, 10 to all saves, all/all, trivial >250 <br>cazicite diamond bracelet: AC 6, hp 30, mana 30, sv cold 13, 11 to all other saves, all/all, trivial >250 <br><br>cazicite sapphire tiara: AC 4, mana 20, HP 20, 10 to all saves <br><br>cazictie ruby veil: AC 2, 9 to all saves, wt 0.1, all/all <br><br>Note that cazicite chunks have been reported to drop on mobs "near the mud temple". <br> <br> </p><p align=center><a href="javascript:history.back()">Click to Return to the Bibliotheca</a></p>
